      "Fundus autofluorescence may show subtle abnormalities"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "Mutations in CNGA3, CNGB3, GNAT2, PDE6C, PDE6H genes associated with autosomal recessive inheritance"
    ],
    "other": [
      "Electroretinogram showing absent or severely reduced cone responses with preserved rod function"
    ]
  },
